      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNKYARD JACK (2) hit the ground running to score by a neck (17.23) at this track over 300m. Drawn to take advantage of good early pace. Should be in this for a long way. TATAMAGOUCHE (1) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (22.91) at Murray Bridge over 395m. Likely to be in the finish again. INVICTUS TOMMY (4) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (17.08) at this track. Has placed several times at this track. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. NOISY GEM (7) was in the money last start and wasn't beaten far - should feature again.",
